-- Row il-61. EXPECTED RED: six assertions, all failing, two for each of the three items. The count (6) is declared in check.sh and in encoding.json.
-- Item I1 (assertions 1 and 2): the consolidation prints in the list of s 4(א) a word that an official instruction read by this row deletes.
-- Item I2 (assertions 3 and 4): the consolidation prints in the list of s 7(א) a number whose section an official instrument read by this row repeals.
-- Item I3 (assertions 5 and 6): the instrument that puts a grant of 200,000 new shekels in a law names a different law and a different section than the line of the consolidation that prints the grant.
-- Each states what the citing words need, or what the two texts would have to agree on. Nothing here is edited to make it pass.
-- The row records this and says nothing about what the citing words are for or whether anyone should change them.

§ `Item I1: a word the consolidation prints in the list and an official instruction deletes`

-- 1. Every entry the consolidation prints in the list of s 4(א) is one that no official instruction read by this row deletes.
#ASSERT `every entry the consolidation prints in the list in s 4(א) is one that no official instruction read by this row deletes`
-- 2. No entry of that list is both printed by the consolidation and deleted by an official instruction read by this row.
#ASSERT `the number of entries of the list in s 4(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instruction deletes` EQUALS 0

§ `Item I2: a number the consolidation prints in the list and an official instrument repeals`

-- 3. Every entry the consolidation prints in the list of s 7(א) names a section that no official instrument read by this row repeals.
#ASSERT `every entry the consolidation prints in the list in s 7(א) names a section that no official instrument read by this row repeals`
-- 4. No entry of that list is both printed by the consolidation and the number of a section that an official instrument read by this row repeals.
#ASSERT `the number of entries of the list in s 7(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instrument repeals the section of` EQUALS 0

§ `Item I3: where the grant of 200,000 new shekels is put`

-- 5. The consolidation and the 2016 instrument put the grant in the same law.
#ASSERT `the two texts put the grant in the same law` (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`) (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)
-- 6. The consolidation and the 2016 instrument put the grant in the same section.
#ASSERT `the two texts put the grant in the same section` (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`) (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)
